# A reader's own configuration, and what a take writes. Neither is committed, and
# `docs/OPEN_SOURCE_READINESS.md` says what each holds and why it must not be published.
# There is no credential here to keep out: the control plane learns who is calling from the
# connection's peer, so this demonstration presents no token, key or session at all.
.env
runtime/

# Python
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.egg-info/
.wheelhouse/
.venv-client/
